mapping "V3728.1" source="V3728" target="217897003" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source V3728 (Swedish extension) = occupant of three-wheeled motor vehicle, collision with
        fixed/stationary object, person on outside of vehicle, nontraffic accident, other specified
        activities. Parent V37.2 crosswalks via Athena to SNOMED CT 436292 (Accidental collision with
        stationary object, 217897003) and 444074 (Victim of vehicular AND/OR traffic accident,
        36198007). Swedish 5th-digit adds activity context (other specified activities) with no separate
        SNOMED CT analogue; injury-event meaning is fully subsumed by the parent crosswalk targets.
        broader: targets fully contain the injury event; activity is contextual refinement. high tier:
        verified Athena crosswalk, one-level specificity loss from activity suffix.
        """
}
