mapping "V3762.1" source="V3762" target="418399005" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source V37.62 = Swedish 7-character extension of ICD-10 V37.6 (passenger of three-wheeled motor
        vehicle injured in collision with fixed/stationary object in traffic accident), with activity
        qualifier SNOMED CT 217897003 36198007 418399005 (while working). SNOMED CT 418399005; 217897003;
        36198007. The activity-context dimension has no SNOMED CT representation; the Athena crosswalk from
        the WHO base code V37.6 yields these three targets. The target subsumes the source because the
        Swedish activity qualifier only narrows within a dimension the standard vocabulary does not
        encode. Confidence (low) — multi-target broader map, residual source, the activity aspect is
        genuinely lost. related for 36198007 (victim status, not the injury itself).
        """
}
mapping "V3762.2" source="V3762" target="217897003" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
}
