mapping "V3763.1" source="V3763" target="418399005" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source V37.63 = V37.6 (passenger of three-wheeled motor vehicle, traffic collision with
        fixed/stationary object) + Swedish activity SNOMED CT 217897003 36198007 418399005 (other
        activity). Same Athena crosswalk from V37.6 to SNOMED CT 418399005/217897003/36198007. Activity
        dimension unrepresented in SNOMED CT; broader map with one-level subsumption. Low confidence per
        rubric: residual Swedish extension, multi-target, aspect-loss.
